---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — 51NAV"
  description="51NAV is your internet start page: a unified entry point for useful tools, websites and resources."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">About 51NAV</h1>
    <div class="guide-content mt-4">
      <p>
        51NAV is <strong>Your Internet Start Page</strong> — a clean, fast hub for useful tools,
        websites and resources. Instead of a cluttered link directory, 51NAV works like a modern
        browser new-tab: a search-first start page that helps you reach the best of the web in a
        click.
      </p>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Start Page</strong> — open your browser and jump to the sites you use daily.</li>
        <li><strong>Resource Directory</strong> — curated categories for AI, Developer, Design, Cloud, Learning and more.</li>
        <li><strong>Tool Gateway</strong> — we connect you to specialized tool sites (Toolhub, Finance Tools, HealthCalcHub, Games, Toolbox).</li>
        <li><strong>SEO Content Hub</strong> — guides and explainers that help you actually use the tools.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>The 51NAV network</h2>
      <p>
        51NAV is the entry point for a small family of focused sites. Each sub-site owns a specific
        job (developer tools, finance calculators, health calculators, games) so 51NAV itself stays
        fast and uncluttered.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions or suggestions? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
